  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Young African Leaders Initiative (YALI) - Patasente Phase 2</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The grant will support the complete development of a robust mobile supply chain financing application fully integrated with the already developed web system with all the necessary features-creditscoring, payments, e-invoicing, loan analysis, investments, portfolio management etc. The application will be available on Android, IOS, and USSD for feature phones. Both the web and mobile application shall be able to enable users to undertake the whole loop. The goal is to enroll 1000 users-buyers or suppliers enterprises onto the platform. With the intention to enroll 10-20 large corporate buyers with 50+ SME suppliers and micro-suppliers in their supply chain linkages onto the platform. As well as raise at least $100,000 at low rates from peer to peer lenders (institutions and individuals) in emerging and developed economies to be invested over the platform.</narrative>
  </description>
